  "Statement compared with calendar: the conference evangelism theme for 2027 is \"Proclaim in One Accord\" (OneVoice27, series in Sept 2027), and its media ministry runs \"Shine the Light\" online Bible studies. These are outside the window or not calendar events, so the 2026 calendar under-states evangelism planned for 2027.",
